## 4. Scoring & `canScore` (LOCKED)

```text
canScore = Boolean(isHost || isDesignatedAdmin)
```

- **Host:** match starter (`host_id` / host route) — camera + score when scoreboard ON  
- **Designated admin:** matches `admin_name` / `scorer_name` (handle / name) — score pad without host camera  
- **Audience:** read-only scoreboard (if ON), center banter, 5 skulls, INVITE — **never** score controls  

| Mode | Host/admin controls (when `canScore && hasScoreboard`) |
|---|---|
| Point sports | Horned skull +1 / −1 (bottom) |
| `CRICKET` | `+1` `+2` `+4` `+6` · `DOT / +1 BALL` · `WICKET` · `UNDO` · `SWAP BATTING` |

Service guards: `canUserScoreMatch` + `updateMatchScore` / `updateMatchCricket` reject `forbidden` when actor cannot score. Do **not** expose score mutation UI or handlers when `!canScore`.

